#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:140
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Create Repeat Customers`: Turn one-time visitors into repeat "
"buyers."
msgstr ":guilabel:`יצירת לקוחות חוזרים`: הפיכת מבקרים חד-פעמיים לקונים חוזרים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:145
msgid "Workflow"
msgstr "תהליך עבודה"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:147
msgid ""
"A *workflow* consists of an activity, many activities, or a sequence of "
"activities organized in a campaign. A campaign's workflow is defined in the "
"section below the campaign form."
msgstr ""
"*זרימת עבודה* מורכבת מפעילות אחת, ממספר פעילויות או מרצף של פעילויות "
"המאורגנות בקמפיין. זרימת העבודה של קמפיין מוגדרת בחלק שמתחת לטופס הקמפיין."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:153
msgid "Activities"
msgstr "פעילויות"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:155
msgid ""
"*Activities* are the methods of communication or server actions, organized "
"in a workflow, that are executed within a campaign. Once running, each "
"activity displays the number of participants that are engaged by the "
"activity as *Success* and *Rejected* counts."
msgstr ""
"*פעילויות* הן שיטות התקשורת או פעולות השרת, המאורגנות בתהליך עבודה, המבוצעות "
"במסגרת קמפיין. ברגע שהן פועלות, כל פעילות מציגה את מספר המשתתפים המעורבים "
"בפעילות כספירות *הצלחה* ו*נדחו*."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:159
msgid ""
"To create one of the following activities, click :guilabel:`Add new "
"activity` and configure the activity."
msgstr ""
"כדי ליצור אחת מהפעילויות הבאות, לחץ על :guilabel:`הוסף פעילות חדשה` והגדר את "
"הפעילות."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:168
msgid "Testing and running"
msgstr "בדיקה והפעלה"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:170
msgid ""
"Once a campaign has been created, it can be tested to ensure the workflow is "
"functioning as expected, to check for errors, and correct any mistakes "
"before it reaches its target audience."
msgstr ""
"לאחר יצירת קמפיין, ניתן לבדוק אותו כדי לוודא שתהליך העבודה פועל כצפוי, לבדוק "
"שגיאות ולתקן טעויות לפני שהוא מגיע לקהל היעד שלו."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:173
msgid ""
"After testing, the campaign can be launched to start engaging the target "
"audience. The campaign can also be launched *without* testing if the user is "
"confident in the workflow."
msgstr ""
"לאחר הבדיקה, ניתן להשיק את הקמפיין כדי להתחיל ליצור מעורבות עם קהל היעד. "
"ניתן להשיק את הקמפיין גם *ללא* בדיקה אם המשתמש בטוח בזרימת העבודה."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:177
msgid ":doc:`marketing_automation/testing_running`"
msgstr ":doc:`marketing_automation/testing_running`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:184
msgid ""
"A range of reporting metrics are available to measure the success of each "
"campaign. Navigate to :menuselection:`Marketing Automation app --> "
"Reporting` to access the following menu options:"
msgstr ""
"מגוון מדדי דיווח זמינים למדידת ההצלחה של כל קמפיין. יש לנווט "
"אל :menuselection:`אפליקציית אוטומציה שיווקית --> דיווח` כדי לגשת לאפשרויות "
"התפריט הבאות:"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:187
msgid ":guilabel:`Link Tracker`: Track the number of clicks through links."
msgstr ":guilabel:`מעקב קישורים`: מעקב אחר מספר הלחיצות דרך קישורים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:188
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Traces`: Track the status of all activities across all campaigns."
msgstr ":guilabel:`מעקבים`: מעקב אחר הסטטוס של כל הפעילויות בכל הקמפיינים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:189
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Participants`: Track participant metrics across all campaigns."
msgstr ":guilabel:`משתתפים`: מעקב אחר מדדי משתתפים בכל הקמפיינים."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:191
msgid ""
"Additionally, each activity within the workflow of a campaign displays its "
"engagement metrics."
msgstr "בנוסף, כל פעילות בתהליך העבודה של קמפיין מציגה את מדדי המעורבות שלה."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation.rst:194
msgid ":doc:`marketing_automation/understanding_metrics`"
msgstr ":doc:`marketing_automation/understanding_metrics`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:3
msgid "Double opt-in"
msgstr "אישור כפול"

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:5
msgid ""
"A *double opt-in*, also referred to as a *confirmed opt-in*, may be required "
"in some countries for marketing communications to comply with anti-spam "
"laws. Confirming consent can also help to validate email addresses, avoid "
"fraudulent subscribers, and keep mailing lists clean."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:9
msgid ""
"When the *Double Opt-in* campaign template is used, a new :doc:`mailing list "
"<../../email_marketing/mailing_lists>` named *Confirmed contacts* is created "
"in the **Email Marketing** app. Any new mailing list contacts added to the "
"default *Newsletter* mailing list are sent an email to confirm their opt-in "
"before they are added to *Confirmed contacts*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:15
msgid ""
"When using the *Double Opt-in* campaign template, only the contacts in the "
"*Confirmed contacts* mailing list are considered to have confirmed their "
"consent."
msgstr ""
"כאשר משתמשים בתבנית הקמפיין *אישור כפול*, רק אנשי הקשר ברשימת *התפוצה של "
"אנשי קשר מאושרים* נחשבים כמי שאישרו את הסכמתם."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:23
msgid ""
"Open the :menuselection:`Marketing Automation` app, click :guilabel:`New`, "
"then select :guilabel:`Load a Template`. On the *Create a Marketing "
"Automation Campaign* pop-up window, select the :guilabel:`Double Opt-in` "
"campaign template and click :guilabel:`Use this Template`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:27
msgid ""
"The workflow builder loads a preconfigured campaign. The first node is "
"a :doc:`trigger <../target_audience>` named :guilabel:`Campaign Start` with "
"the following configuration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/campaign_templates/double_optin.rst:30
