msgid "Enrollment tab"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:26
msgid ""
"The *Enrollment* tab provides options to define the target audience and "
"campaign triggers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:28
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Target` field, specify the model the participant comes "
"from (e.g., Contact, Event Sponsor, Applicant)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:31
msgid ""
"Then, select the :guilabel:`Trigger type` to specify when a record becomes a "
"participant via one of the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:34
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Filter`: Add any record that matches the filter rules set in "
"the :guilabel:`Dynamic Lists` or :guilabel:`Filter` fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:36
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Event`: Add a record when one of the following events "
"occurs: :guilabel:`Subscribed to List`, :guilabel:`Page "
"Visited`, :guilabel:`Form Submitted`, :guilabel:`Product in Cart`, "
"or :guilabel:`Product Bought`. This option **only** applies to Contacts or "
"Leads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:39
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Date`: Add a record at a specific time before or after a date. In "
"the :guilabel:`Date field`, specify the appropriate date on the "
"chosen :guilabel:`Target`. In the :guilabel:`Delay` field, choose a duration "
"before or after which the record should be created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:42
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Anniversary`: Add a record at a specific time relative to its "
"date, repeating every year. In the :guilabel:`Date field`, specify the "
"appropriate date on the chosen :guilabel:`Target`. In the :guilabel:`Delay` "
"field, choose a duration before or after which the record should be created."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:46
msgid ":guilabel:`Manual`: Add a record manually **only**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/marketing_automation/target_audience.rst:47
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Webhook`: Add a record when an external app sends a request to a "
"specified URL."
msgstr ""

